<h1>Hi!</h1>

<p>You requested a password reset for your Mifania account.</p>

<p>To reset your password in the Mifania app, tap the link below:</p>

<p>
    <a href="mifania://reset-password?token={{ resetToken.token }}">Open Mifania app to reset password</a>
</p>

<p>If the app does not open, you can also reset your password on the web:</p>

<p>
    <a href="{{ url('app_reset_password', {token: resetToken.token}) }}">{{ url('app_reset_password', {token: resetToken.token}) }}</a>
</p>

<p>This link will expire in {{ resetToken.expirationMessageKey|trans(resetToken.expirationMessageData, 'ResetPasswordBundle') }}.</p>

<p>If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>

<p>Cheers!</p>
